FLAML (https://github.com/microsoft/FLAML) — algorithm source, no code copied

The cost-frugal optimization (CFO) with FLOW2 local search and the estimated cost for improvement
(ECI) trainer selection implemented in MLoop.Search are described in:

  Wu, Wang, Huang. "Frugal Optimization for Cost-related Hyperparameters." AAAI 2021.
  Wang, Wu, Weimer, Zhu. "FLAML: A Fast and Lightweight AutoML Library." MLSys 2021.
